Foreign investors and their family members, shareholders, directors, deputy directors wishing to apply 
for business visas to conduct business activities in the enterprise located on territory of Lao PDR shall 
fulfill the following conditions:  
 Be a legitimate investor in accordance with the laws and regulations of Lao PDR;  
 Indicate that shareholders, directors, deputy directors are listed in the Article of Incorporation or 
organization of the corporation approved by the planning and investment or industry and 
commerce sector;  
 Clear resume; not escaping from any court proceeding by coming and investing in Lao PDR;   
 Follow the laws and customs of Lao PDR;  
 Be in good health; free from contagious diseases which are prohibited by the World Health 
Organization;   
Investors and their family members, shareholders, directors, deputy directors wishing to apply for 
business visas shall complete the form (s) provided by the one -stop service office of the planning and 
investment sector.
